/-!
# Sylow conjugacy classes and ambient fusion words

These definitions keep the two finite stages separate. The 140 catalogue
rows have tabulated conjugators to 28 Sylow classes; each class has an
ambient word and a selected fixed representative. The actual subgroup
equalities are proved in the importing modules.

Source: GLS, Number 3, Table 5.3h, printed p.269; the fixed ATLAS J₃
model. The JSON files in `Coverage/source` are untrusted discovery data.
-/

